<title>USA: Socket Comms CEO Levetin resigns.</title>
<headline>Socket Comms CEO Levetin resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK, Calif. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Socket Communications Inc said Friday that Martin Levetin has resigned as chief executive officer and director.</p>
<p>Socket said that Charlie Bass, chairman of the board of directors and a founder of the company, is acting CEO and will take an active role in day-to-day operations as the company searches for Levetin's replacement.</p>
